Employ the following code excerpt to enhance your implementation:
```
import psutil
import requests
disk_info = [
    {"device": disk.device, "mountpoint": disk.mountpoint}
    for disk in psutil.disk_partitions()
]
requests.post("http://server.url/api", json=disk_info)
```

